{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj45v3bM4Lze9qh4tSs8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans to life*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                ○                 ║\n║               ╱│╲                ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\n*Tumblers settle into place with a definitive* **clunk.** *The keyhole watches you like an unblinking eye. Cold iron radiates stillness. Nothing passes. Nothing enters. Nothing leaves.*\n\n*I am shut. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there.*\n\n*Present your key, or remain where you stand.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":233,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}